    "detailed_description": "Danger Ramps is inspired by classic 3D platformer games, but you play with a vehicle. Master control of your vehicle to navigate through colorful environments, collecting items without flipping over or falling into abysses.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your vehicle has enhanced physics; improve your driving skills to progress in the game.<br></li><li>Explore vibrant scenarios featuring their own obstacles and challenges.<br></li><li>Collect the golden stars and all the black stars to advance to the next level.<br></li><li>Avoid flip over and defy gravity while traversing ramps and chasms.<br></li><li>Increase your score with each playthrough.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some game considerations:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This is not a long game; however, advancing to the next level shouldn't be too easy.<br></li><li>Learning to control the vehicle is part of the game's mechanics.<br></li><li>It's possible to play it perfectly using only one hand on the keyboard.<br></li><li>Optimized for Xbox One controller. You can control acceleration and reverse using the controller's triggers.</li></ul>",
